  <description>
    <p>LvW-bench scores small language models on your own computer, in three tracks: typed decisions (System 1), answers with thinking off and reasoning with thinking on (System 2).</p>
    <p>This Flatpak runs GGUF models with the llama.cpp server it includes. Safetensors models need uv, which isn't included.</p>
  </description>
